:["伊索尔德","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515001.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……我记得，在上周，您说我们已经完成了关于餐桌的礼仪训练，是我对您的话理解有误吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你的理解没有失误，孩子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["绅士拿起银汤匙，将其放在姑娘手中，缓慢地收拢她的手指，好帮助她捏紧汤匙。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017826","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但是昨晚，在和你父母的聚餐上，我发现你的手时常颤抖。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["它微小、孱弱、细不可闻，在大部分时候无法被察觉。刀叉的移动短而快捷，不足以显露，更是会在切割牛排时完全融入动作之中。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但喝汤时不一样，它会彻底地显现。人们都会注意到，你的袖口在用餐中被打湿，留下痕迹。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,64,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["卡尔微笑着松开手。小伊索尔德不再需要他的帮忙。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她的面色平静，可手下捏着汤匙的手指紧绷，末端发白，轻微颤抖。<br>她总是最清楚自己需要完成什么，又要成为什么。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017824","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当然，这一点小小的失误称不上失礼，但远不够完美，孩子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我们已经做了十全十的努力，没有必要在此功亏一篑。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,111,""]],"type":1,"name":["伊索尔德","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"515001.png","audio":"610017807","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是的，卡尔先生……我会好好练习。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017820","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一百次。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["绅士满意地在宽阔的客厅内踏出一步，鞋底与地板相互咬合。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我让小伊索尔德重复舀起了一百次汤匙。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她是伊文洁琳的孩子，维也纳有史以来最伟大的歌剧女演员的孩子，她长得和她那样相似，几乎一模一样。她怎么能在盛汤时颤抖呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017826","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……这太不体面了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["啧啧感叹，卡尔摇动头颅，漂亮的黑发在他脑后如同绸缎一般闪烁。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017820","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我不是没有注意到伊索尔德的疲倦，尽管她没有展现出任何疲惫的样子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但无论如何她都只是一个十二岁的孩子，一个十二岁的孩子，在三小时的姿态礼仪课之后，又要重复一个小时这样的训练，她当然疲累。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但她还在坚持，就像是我们期待的那样。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["面带微笑，声音柔和，眼神温顺得如同春日的水，姿态如同羊羔。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017825","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她的努力当然是有意义的，这有所回报……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"79":{"step":[[79,80,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["绅士在窗边停下脚步，他的目光眺望着外头的花园。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"80":{"step":[[80,81,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["阳光遍布的草坪上，伊文洁琳正抱着一只雪白的兔子，她为它梳理毛发，一次又一次。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她的手腕在前二十次时还在紧绷、发抖，但到了第六十五次之后，这种症状就开始减轻了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"82":{"step":[[82,83,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["也许是因为疲累，也许是因为麻木，也许是因为顿悟带来的平静。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"83":{"step":[[83,84,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["到了第一百次，她汤匙中的小水面安静得像是一片银镜子，可以清晰地照出我的脸。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"84":{"step":[[84,85,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["卡尔移回目光。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"85":{"step":[[85,86,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["桌面上的汤早已凉透，椅子倾斜地摆放着，伊索尔德不知去了哪里。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"86":{"step":[[86,87,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017824","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我不知道她为什么如此颤抖，也许是肌肉问题，也许是因为那家族遗传的天分带来的疯病。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"87":{"step":[[87,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但我知道，只要再不到一周，她就可以永远地告别那糟糕的、像是癫痫病人一样的颤抖。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"88":{"step":[[88,89,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["成为比伊文洁琳更完美的伊文洁琳。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"89":{"step":[[89,90,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017818","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你瞧，这就是教育的好处，如果我能回到过去，带给伊文洁琳这些机会……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"90":{"step":[[90,91,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"91":{"step":[[91,92,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017822","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你在惊讶？为什么？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"92":{"step":[[92,93,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["虽然我喜爱伊文洁琳，是她忠实的观众，永远的聆听者，但这不代表我要忽视她的缺陷。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"93":{"step":[[93,94,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她疯狂，不稳定，总是昏迷，又会陷入惊恐，高声尖叫甚至失禁……她是可怜人，但也是个不值得敬仰的女人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"94":{"step":[[94,95,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017825","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是的，人们围绕着她；是的，在降灵会上总有大人物热切地注视她；是的，她总有收不完的鲜花，在她的舞台之下，狂热的粉丝因为过度的兴奋而晕厥。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"95":{"step":[[95,96,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017826","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这些并不代表“身份”，只能代表“关注”，我亲爱的朋友。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"96":{"step":[[96,97,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["卡尔摊开双手，肩膀向上耸起，这是一个代表无奈的经典动作。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"97":{"step":[[97,98,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他在桌边坐下，盘中的冷汤在一眨眼之间变为一块巧克力蛋糕。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"98":{"step":[[98,99,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你应当品尝过萨赫蛋糕吧？两块美妙的巧克力，一层无与伦比的杏子酱，构成一个完满的圆。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"99":{"step":[[99,100,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["银叉在绅士手中，他调转方向，露出蛋糕上的霉菌。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"100":{"step":[[100,101,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["伊文洁琳正是一块这样的蛋糕，从某一个边角开始腐朽，就像她的歌声，她的占卜，她的疯狂与她的癔症。她的大部分都是甜美的，小部分则令人作呕。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"101":{"step":[[101,102,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017824","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我们不能丢掉她，这样对她和我们来说都太可惜了。我们舍不得这样的美。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"102":{"step":[[102,103,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["叉子侧边陷入蛋糕体，巧克力淋面在推挤中呈现出褶皱，恰好地推开霉菌。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"103":{"step":[[103,104,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所以社会为她留下一扇门，所以我们注意使用叉子的方法，所以迪塔斯多夫仍然迎娶了她。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"104":{"step":[[104,105,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"610017820","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……但这总归是一个麻烦的过程。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/sufubihaozhai.jpg","choice":[]},"105":{"step":[[105,106,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡尔","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["萨赫蛋糕如此美味，人们品尝其中滋味